📈 Data-center spending is greater than that for the canals, railroads and grid combined.

AI infrastructure investment is projected to average 3.63% of GDP annually from 2025 to 2032. Railroads averaged 2.24% during their build-out. Highways reached 1.13%, and telecom and fiber 1.1%. Its the biggest investment bet in the history.

